# Regression for flaw-and-Add.md A-5 (to_float half): myon.string.to_float
# set errno=0 but never checked errno==ERANGE, so an out-of-range string
# saturated to HUGE_VAL and was reported as a success.  After the fix an
# overflowing input must return an "out of range" error value.
module myon.stdio
module myon.string

v, e = myon.string.to_float(str("1e400"))
myon.print(e)
